sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Web as Web App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Identity Service
    participant Orders as Order Service
    participant Queue as Event Bus

    User->>Web: Submit order
    Web->>API: POST /orders
    API->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>API: Identity + scopes
    API->>Orders: Create order
    par Persist and publish
        Orders->>Orders: Store order
    and Notify downstream systems
        Orders->>Queue: order.created
    end
    Orders-->>API: 201 Created
    API-->>Web: Order response
    Web-->>User: Confirmation
